  "content": "<h1>Zryak 的無敵裝甲</h1>\n<p>為 Minecraft 增加強大的裝甲</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/JuggernautArmor.PNG\" alt=\"無敵裝甲\"></p>\n<h2>製作無敵裝甲</h2>\n<p>無敵像大多數裝甲部件一樣製作，但是使用下界合金錠。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/HelmetRecipe.PNG\" alt=\"頭盔配方\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/ChestplateRecipe.PNG\" alt=\"胸甲配方\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/LeggingsRecipe.PNG\" alt=\"護腿配方\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/BootsRecipe.PNG\" alt=\"靴子配方\"></p>\n<h2>使用</h2>\n<p>無敵提供的防禦點比下界合金更多</p>\n<p>在下界中穿著下界合金或無敵裝甲被末影人擊中</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/NetheriteExample.PNG\" alt=\"下界合金範例\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/JuggernautExample.PNG\" alt=\"無敵範例\"></p>\n<p>穿著任何一件無敵裝甲會給予緩慢 I 和挖掘疲勞 I</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NoahMcGrail/Zryak-s-Juggernaut-Armor/refs/heads/main/images/JuggernautPotionEffects.PNG\" alt=\"藥水效果\"></p>",
